{"2898310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EXOcars", "steam_appid": 2898310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898310/extras/5289e7fc9e65a089fb700d8ceca5d9a4.avif?t=1738856065\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>SPEED AND SPECTACLE</strong><br><br>From streets and stadiums to deserts, mountains and a tropical paradise - Track design in EXOcars pays close attention to landscape, surface type, and terrain relief.<br><br>Featuring ramps, drifts, and natural obstacles, it makes you feel like an actual driver of a roaring buggy car, speeding through stunning scenery!<br><br><strong>FEEL THE ROAD</strong><br><br>EXOcars offers high graphical fidelity with rock-solid framerate. <br><br>In addition to that, the game is based on real car physics, ensuring a unique and immersive driving experience. Suspension dynamics and track surface interactions make every race feel fresh and thrilling.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898310/extras/aded33e8d074c612397d812cddfaee9d.poster.avif?t=1738856065\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898310/extras/aded33e8d074c612397d812cddfaee9d.webm?t=1738856065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>MAKE YOUR FRIENDS BITE THE DUST</strong><br><br>Each single-player race puts you against ghosts of real opponents matched to your skill level, allowing you to progress and become a top-notch pilot organically.<br><br>Real-time multiplayer modes let you compete with friends. Or find new ones in social lobbies!<br><br>Make use of car customization, hand gestures and an optional voice chat to show off your personality. <b